                    },
                    "message": "Can you please review my implementation"
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 978,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "The constant sensor::operationalStatusInterface is already defined at line 258 for this exact string. Please use the constant here instead of the hardcoded literal to avoid a potential mismatch if the interface name is updated in the future."
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 978,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "tausiffmujawar",
                        "email": "tausiff-hussain-umarsab.mujawar@hpe.com",
                        "username": "tausiffmujawar"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you for the review, I have replaced string with constant at line 978."
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 978,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 978,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 986,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "std::get<bool> will throw std::bad_variant_access if the variant holds a type other than bool, which would crash the IPMI daemon. This can happen if a D-Bus provider implements the OperationalStatus interface with a non-standard property type (e.g., uint8_t instead of bool). This would take down all IPMI functionality until systemd restarts the daemon"
                },
                {
                    "file": "dbus-sdr/sensorcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 986,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "tausiffmujawar",
                        "email": "tausiff-hussain-umarsab.mujawar@hpe.com",
                        "username": "tausiffmujawar"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you for the review. I have handled error condition to handle non bool types."
                },
